    "created_at": "2017-02-24T05:00:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-02-24T05:00:41Z",
    "body": "I don't think we should add a warning specific to dialog. The entire focus section right now does not take into account shadow DOM. There's nothing special about dialog; the same warning applies to every element.",
