    "created_at": "2017-02-24T17:18:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-02-24T17:18:52Z",
    "body": "No, I still think it makes no sense to have this warning be in the dialog section at all. There is no algorithm in the HTML spec for focus *at all* with shadow DOM. What we need is a warning saying that if you are looking at _anything in the focus section_, the HTML spec does not have a well-defined algorithm for dealing with shadow DOM. Dialog is not special.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
