    "updated_at": "2017-02-25T05:29:34Z",
    "body": "Yeah, I agree with @domenic that this warning is misleading given the focus navigation behavior isn't defined for all other cases involving the shadow tree. It's probably better to not add this, and spec the whole focus navigation ordering sometime later.",
