    "updated_at": "2017-02-27T15:47:18Z",
    "body": "Concretely, would it make sense to have a warning in https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#focus and do we have a more generic issue than https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/2393 to link to? Or maybe rename that one?\r\n\r\nWe don't have warnings for all outstanding warnings however, but as a test for when we could use one, any implementer wanting it seems fair.",
